# Input

```md
[link](destination "title")
[link](destination 'title')
[link](destination (title))

[double](destination "\"")
[single](destination '\'')
[parenthesis](destination (\)))
[mixed](destination (Shakespeare's "Romeo and Juliet" is a famous play))

[backslash](destination "\\\"")
[unnecessary](destination "\'\!\#")
[entities](destination "\&ouml; &ouml; &\#246; &amp\;")
[multiline](destination 'first
second')
[escaped-multiline](destination "first
\* second")

![image](destination 'title')

[reference]: destination 'title'
[complex-reference]: destination (Shakespeare's "Romeo and Juliet" is a famous play)

[empty-double](destination "")
[empty-single](destination '')
[empty-parentheses](destination ())

[spaces](destination "  ")

```


